  "claims": [
    {
      "id": "claim_ca60acb3e2e145b084e70102fc32aa2a",
      "statement": "EasySAM's `easysam local .` command starts a FastAPI + uvicorn server that reuses `load.resources()` from `load.py` to map resolved `paths` and `functions` into FastAPI routes, then invokes Lambda handlers in-process with per-request isolation — real cloud resources remain on AWS while only API Gateway routing and auth layers are mocked.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/specs/local-lambda-execution.md#L5-L6",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bb54125c201ad3a8946af124c6351b95294429e6635b38c270f7b9258b49ea1b:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/local_cli.py#L74-L95",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:69b2520c43437e9b249aa0817a47b450a667b9a55ecde542f9e13e534b31e73c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/local_server.py#L53-L87",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b01983517b72e2849920f58e827db349ecc9835fe742a5a2ee4b76ddd02073f2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b289dc73fd644457a335a8b74c960f47",
      "statement": "Handler isolation is achieved per-request via `isolated_import_context(project_root, lambda_dir)` in `local_handler.py`, which sets `sys.path = [lambda_dir, project_root] + sys.path`, imports the handler through `importlib.util.spec_from_file_location` with a unique module name, and purges only modules whose resolved `__file__` originates from `project_root` or `lambda_dir` on exit — preserving third-party packages like boto3 in `sys.modules`.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/critiques/local-lambda-execution-critique-pass2.md#L42-L48",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:8265edf27ea280f09a271a7918be6ba08e94402cbdb338d1464ff4ad8a414b86:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/specs/local-lambda-execution.md#L102-L131",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:3d54f8a03be55eb323e63069d323f3a1e5358367826b5c3a4ecac2fb76ebf43d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/local_handler.py#L37-L80",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2a64fdca83375d8db179da84d1ec8684dc93f44cb78278bf6222cc7421767bd4:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_95c866e6b847486fbc4dbdb76e647b0a",
      "statement": "The `load_and_invoke` function in `local_handler.py` detects async handlers with `inspect.iscoroutinefunction(handler)` and awaits them directly; sync handlers are invoked in a freshly created event loop run via `asyncio.get_event_loop().run_in_executor(None, ...)`, returning the result dict.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/specs/local-lambda-execution.md#L133-L151",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:fd0454413a2e15a80de01cd3b09130b66704bef9a4fda5b8c96f63083eb3bba2:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/easysam/local_handler.py#L83-L112",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ee0d3828b062216ea9dc4d230c5f4fc05fc84bd607b02d5755b40a68abc56520:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_082d698c86714656b77ec33ac976be6a",
      "statement": "The local server supports both API Gateway REST API (v1) and HTTP API (v2) event formats selectable via `--event-format v1|v2` (default `v1`), with `build_rest_api_event` synthesizing v1 payloads (including `multiValueHeaders` and `multiValueQueryStringParameters` built via `request.query_params.multi_items()`) and `build_http_api_event` synthesizing v2 payloads (with `version: '2.0'`, lowercase comma-joined headers, and `requestContext.authorizer.lambda`).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://docs/specs/local-lambda-execution.md#L155-L207",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:2a5d812b4b1e9c8198f9191a62c8ccf3fb0864914694549b68ae79475f46062e:"
        },
        {
