      "id": "claim_d89dc613edcf4c7ab9eeb92c24da5887",
      "statement": "Structured request logging uses the format `[METHOD] /path -> FunctionName (statusCode, duration_ms)` with `time.perf_counter()` for duration, emitted per request after the response is determined.",
