    {
      "id": "claim_723b8747471643d39dad1b5141bd0135",
      "statement": "The local execution feature went through three formal review artifacts before merge: a brainstorm (2026-07), two critique passes (2026-08-03) that identified Must-Address items for thread safety, async handler support, v2 response wrapping, selective module purge, and route specificity sorting, and a second-pass code review (2026-08-04) that confirmed all four Pass 1 defects resolved, lint reduced from 19 to 0, and all 74 unit/integration tests passing — resulting in an APPROVE decision for PR #30.",
